From 4563150f7e3f5eccda69126ee4acc2ea34f7dd1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Kennedy <nick@nick-kennedy.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:38:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] kosmickrisp: add an opt-in light_barriers experiment

With MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=light_barriers, encoders no longer end with a
barrier on all stages. Pipeline barriers recorded between encoders are
converted to Metal stages and applied at the start of the next render
encoder. Compute encoders, the start of each command buffer, render pass
restarts and splits, resumed passes and the custom resolve switch keep a
full barrier. vkCmdWaitEvents2 applies its dependencies as barriers.

Alyx's desktop menu GPU time drops from 11.0 to 8.2 ms median.

KK_BARRIER_STATS=1 logs the most frequent barrier stage and access masks
recorded with no encoder open.

AI-written commit text (biblioklept).

